# #5837: the reachability latch exemption and the split transfer's link obligation.
MODULE: RepairLatchesPendingExemptionOverridesOrphanRepair
TARGET: RepairLatches
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the exemption holds while orphan repair re-homes L's range, so the repair's owner misses L's stamped writes (a5e2e2ef's condition 3)
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithLatch = TRUE

--- FIND
ExemptPending == BoundPending /\ ~eagerG /\ ~repair
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: orphan repair does not end the exemption.
ExemptPending == BoundPending /\ ~eagerG
--- END
